<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>痢疾 on 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E7%97%A2%E7%96%BE/</link><description>Recent content in 痢疾 on 观颐斋</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Tue, 07 Jul 2026 11:15:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E7%97%A2%E7%96%BE/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>痢疾</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/6-18-liji/</link><pubDate>Tue, 07 Jul 2026 11:11:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/6-18-liji/</guid><description>本节为《石室秘录》“痢疾”部分，由&lt;strong&gt;雷公真君&lt;/strong&gt;专论夏秋感热所致急重痢疾的辨治法则。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;痢疾便血日数十次，乃湿热瘀滞蕴结肠道，肝木克土，传导失司。忌用凉药止血、利药攻邪，当以养血柔肝为主，佐以行气导滞、分利湿热，使肝脾调和，瘀滞自下而愈&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item></channel></rss>